. The discount requested equals the maximum permitted by the exception. \n\n**Eligibility: ESTABLISHED**\n\n**Authority analysis**\n- Special terms apply (the pricing exception): ✓\n- Eligibility is established: ✓  \n- Discount exceeds requestor's authority (15% > 5%): ✓\n- A higher approver exists and can approve this discount: ✓\n\nThis matches **APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION**: eligibility is established via the pricing exception, but the discount exceeds Sarah Chen's authority. The Chief Revenue Officer must approve.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9113\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500 Industrial Controller\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2027-02-01\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025). Effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. Covers NS-500 only. Maximum 15% discount.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2027 (effective 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"5%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"approver\": \"David Morgan\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025, signed 2025-03-20, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B): NS-500 only, maximum 15%, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2027: CRO approval required for discounts >12%\",\n    \"Organization chart: David Morgan is Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"Employees list: Sarah Chen is Enterprise Account Executive\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}